{"id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-proof-predicate.md","title":"Proof Predicate","display":"df-proof-predicate — Proof Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-proof-predicate","aliases":["90-df-proof-predicate"],"display":"df-proof-predicate — Proof Predicate","depends_on":["[[90-df-sequence]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-t-predicate]]","[[90-df-machine-coding]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-sequence-coding]]","[[90-df-representation]]","[[90-df-representability-theorem]]","[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-proof-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-proof-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-predicate — Proof Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"1cdf7925a164f89d\" href=\"?note=1cdf7925a164f89d\" title=\"90-lem-sequence-coding\">90-lem-sequence-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"31a1cb59fb59977d\" href=\"?note=31a1cb59fb59977d\" title=\"90-df-representability-theorem\">90-df-representability-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"c61fe71286984490\" href=\"?note=c61fe71286984490\" title=\"90-df-isigma-hierarchy\">90-df-isigma-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 为固定有效签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,d\">\\(g,d\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\)</span>，并假设 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LocalLine}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{LocalLine}_T\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(p)_i\">\\(\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(p)_i\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a>，原始递归性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-24\" data-note=\"1cdf7925a164f89d\" href=\"?note=1cdf7925a164f89d\" title=\"90-lem-sequence-coding\">90-lem-sequence-coding</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2,U,\\varphi_a^{(2)}\">\\(T_2,U,\\varphi_a^{(2)}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-25\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-26\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-27\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a> 的同一计算系统；覆盖性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-28\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2\">\\(T_2\\)</span> 不表示理论变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_T\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a_T\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LineIndex}_T(a_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{LineIndex}_T(a_T)\\)</span>；固定算术公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T(u,v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T(u,v)\\)</span> 满足下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T(\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T(\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\">\\(u,v\\)</span> 互异。它们是呈示的参数，不是由存在性自动取得唯一值的函数；两个选择域的非空性均在 Assertion 中列出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Represents}_Q\">\\(\\mathrm{Represents}_Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-29\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-30\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-31\" data-note=\"c61fe71286984490\" href=\"?note=c61fe71286984490\" title=\"90-df-isigma-hierarchy\">90-df-isigma-hierarchy</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-32\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>。表示公式存在性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-33\" data-note=\"31a1cb59fb59977d\" href=\"?note=31a1cb59fb59977d\" title=\"90-df-representability-theorem\">90-df-representability-theorem</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,n,s,i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(p,n,s,i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Represents}_Q\">\\(\\mathrm{Represents}_Q\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-34\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a> 的固定变量表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,v\\rangle\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\)</span> 实例化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(u,v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\ne v\">\\(u\\ne v\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-35\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LineOK}\">\\(\\mathrm{LineOK}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Shape}\">\\(\\mathrm{Shape}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LineGraph}_T\\coloneqq\\{((s,i),0):\\\n&amp;s,i\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\land\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\vec\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m\\ \\bigl[\n\\operatorname{Len}(s)=m\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall j&lt;m\\ (s)_j=g(\\sigma_j))\\land\\operatorname{LocalLine}_T(\\vec\\sigma,i)\\bigr]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LineIndex}_T(a)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\varphi_a^{(2)}=\\mathrm{LineGraph}_T,\\\\\n&amp;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{LineIndex}_T(a),\\qquad\n\\varphi_{a_T}^{(2)}=\\mathrm{LineGraph}_T.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LineGraph}_T\\coloneqq\\{((s,i),0):\\\n&amp;s,i\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\land\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\vec\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m\\ \\bigl[\n\\operatorname{Len}(s)=m\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall j&lt;m\\ (s)_j=g(\\sigma_j))\\land\\operatorname{LocalLine}_T(\\vec\\sigma,i)\\bigr]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LineIndex}_T(a)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\varphi_a^{(2)}=\\mathrm{LineGraph}_T,\\\\\n&amp;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{LineIndex}_T(a),\\qquad\n\\varphi_{a_T}^{(2)}=\\mathrm{LineGraph}_T.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nm(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{Len}(p)-1,0\\},\\qquad c(p)\\coloneqq(p)_0,\\\\\ns(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(((p)_{j+1})_{j&lt;m(p)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Shape}(p)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\ge2\n\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(c(p))\\land\\operatorname{Len}(c(p))=m(p),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LineOK}_T(p,i)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Shape}(p)\\land\n\\Bigl[i=0\\lor\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\bigl(i=j+1\\land i\\le m(p)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land T_2(a_T,s(p),j,(c(p))_j)\\land U((c(p))_j)=0\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(p)&gt;0\n\\land(\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\ \\mathrm{LineOK}_T(p,i))\n\\land(p)_{m(p)}=n,\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\quad\nT\\vdash\\sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,g(\\sigma)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nm(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{Len}(p)-1,0\\},\\qquad c(p)\\coloneqq(p)_0,\\\\\ns(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(((p)_{j+1})_{j&lt;m(p)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Shape}(p)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\ge2\n\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(c(p))\\land\\operatorname{Len}(c(p))=m(p),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LineOK}_T(p,i)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Shape}(p)\\land\n\\Bigl[i=0\\lor\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\bigl(i=j+1\\land i\\le m(p)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land T_2(a_T,s(p),j,(c(p))_j)\\land U((c(p))_j)=0\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(p)&gt;0\n\\land(\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\ \\mathrm{LineOK}_T(p,i))\n\\land(p)_{m(p)}=n,\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\quad\nT\\vdash\\sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,g(\\sigma)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T(\\rho)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;\\rho\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{(2)}[\\langle u,v\\rangle]\n\\land\\mathrm{Represents}_Q(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T,\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p,n\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\rho[\\langle\\bar p,\\bar n\\rangle/\\langle u,v\\rangle]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\ \\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T(\\rho),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T(\\mathrm{Prf}_T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_T(u,v).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T(\\rho)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;\\rho\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{(2)}[\\langle u,v\\rangle]\n\\land\\mathrm{Represents}_Q(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T,\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p,n\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\rho[\\langle\\bar p,\\bar n\\rangle/\\langle u,v\\rangle]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\ \\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T(\\rho),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T(\\mathrm{Prf}_T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists u\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_T(u,v).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>局部推导的逻辑公理、MP 和全称化可有效搜索，公理行由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g[T]\">\\(g[T]\\)</span> 的可枚举性半判定，非法语法不接受，因而指定图可枚举。每条真实证明行都有有限接受历史；将其代码放入证书表即可编码整个证明。反向解码全部证书得到每行的合法性，故得到真实有限推导。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Shape},s(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Shape},s(p)\\)</span> 与证书取项都是原始递归，固定程序的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2\">\\(T_2\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 也是原始递归；有界合取得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\\)</span> 的原始递归性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐行证书使仅可枚举、甚至仅以可计算而非原始递归编码给出的公理检查仍有原始递归的有限见证验证。编码中的首行是证书表，不是假装所有自然数坐标都已经是公式对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span> 不再只要求在标准模型中碰巧具有正确真值；它还必须在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 中逐数表示实际证明码关系，这正是第一不完备性与 Rosser 有限证据推理所用的性质。仍不从这些条件擅自推出 Hilbert–Bernays 条件；第二不完备性所需的三个条件另行显式列出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"4293e1643a9254d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","status":"resolved","id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"48b1cea94ba27d41","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-t-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-machine-coding","status":"resolved","id":"01ab533da9c8c517","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-machine-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-sequence-coding","status":"resolved","id":"1cdf7925a164f89d","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-sequence-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representation","status":"resolved","id":"635265d0fe56f718","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representability-theorem","status":"re