:"$\\mathrm{Represents}_Q$、$Q$、$\\Sigma_1$、$\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 分别见 [[90-df-representation]]、[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]、[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]、[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]。表示公式存在性见 [[90-df-representability-theorem]]。$p,n,s,i\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-32","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Represents}_Q$、$Q$、$\\Sigma_1$、$\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 分别见 [[90-df-representation]]、[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]、[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]、[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]。表示公式存在性见 [[90-df-representability-theorem]]。$p,n,s,i\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representability-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"31a1cb59fb59977d","anchor":"ref-33","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Represents}_Q$、$Q$、$\\Sigma_1$、$\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 分别见 [[90-df-representation]]、[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]、[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]、[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]。表示公式存在性见 [[90-df-representability-theorem]]。$p,n,s,i\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representation","status":"resolved","id":"635265d0fe56f718","anchor":"ref-34","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T$ 中的 $\\mathrm{Represents}_Q$ 按 [[90-df-representation]] 的固定变量表 $\\langle u,v\\rangle$ 实例化；$u,v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}$，$u\\ne v$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-35","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{PRPred}$ 取 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"g,d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LocalLine}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(p)_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}","display":false},{"tex":"T_2,U,\\varphi_a^{(2)}","display":false},{"tex":"T_2","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"a_T\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LineIndex}_T(a_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_T(u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T(\\mathrm{Prf}_T)","display":false},{"tex":"u,v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Represents}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"p,n,s,i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Represents}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle u,v\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}","display":false},{"tex":"u\\ne v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRPred}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LineOK}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Shape}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LineGraph}_T\\coloneqq\\{((s,i),0):\\\n&s,i\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\land\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists\\vec\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m\\ \\bigl[\n\\operatorname{Len}(s)=m\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall j<m\\ (s)_j=g(\\sigma_j))\\land\\operatorname{LocalLine}_T(\\vec\\sigma,i)\\bigr]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LineIndex}_T(a)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\varphi_a^{(2)}=\\mathrm{LineGraph}_T,\\\\\n&\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\mathrm{LineIndex}_T(a),\\qquad\n\\varphi_{a_T}^{(2)}=\\mathrm{LineGraph}_T.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nm(p)&\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{Len}(p)-1,0\\},\\qquad c(p)\\coloneqq(p)_0,\\\\\ns(p)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(((p)_{j+1})_{j<m(p)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Shape}(p)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\ge2\n\\land\\operatorname{Seq}(c(p))\\land\\operatorname{Len}(c(p))=m(p),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LineOK}_T(p,i)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Shape}(p)\\land\n\\Bigl[i=0\\lor\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\bigl(i=j+1\\land i\\le m(p)\\\\\n&\\hspace{13em}\\land T_2(a_T,s(p),j,(c(p))_j)\\land U((c(p))_j)=0\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(p)>0\n\\land(\\forall i<\\operatorname{Len}(p)\\ \\mathrm{LineOK}_T(p,i))\n\\land(p)_{m(p)}=n,\\\\\n&\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2,\\\\\n&\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\quad\nT\\vdash\\sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,g(\\sigma)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T(\\rho)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&\\rho\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{(2)}[\\langle u,v\\rangle]\n\\land\\mathrm{Represents}_Q(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T,\\rho)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p,n\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\rho[\\langle\\bar p,\\bar n\\rangle/\\langle u,v\\rangle]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,n)),\\\\\n&\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\ \\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T(\\rho),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{PrfAdeq}_T(\\mathrm{Prf}_T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)&\\coloneqq\\exists u\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_T(u,v).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"g[T]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Shape},s(p)","display":false},{"tex":"T_2","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_T","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false}],"bytes":5942,"backlinks":[{"id":"953666dcda2baf50","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 的同一 $g,\\mathrm{Prf}_T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T$；标准模型是 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]] 的结构（若 $S$ 有额外符号，取其指定的标准算术扩张）。"},{"id":"3a69a5b2bc6a0fd7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_T(H)$、$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 见 [[90-df-henkin-sentence]]、[[90-df-proof-predicate]]；$S,g,d,T$ 为同一编码环境。"},{"id":"fca5455005daa120","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"全部语法与可证性使用 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]] 的同一环境；涉及 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 时，还使用 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 中已声明的有效公理化证明呈示，不从 $\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}$ 单独推定公理可枚举。"},{"id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"含 $\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T$、$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 或 $\\mathrm{Con}_T$ 的式子另固定 $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 及 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 的同一完整证明呈示，满足该文件关于签名、$g,d$、有效公理化、行验证器和所选证明公式的全部条件。数码和标准结构见 [[90-df-numeral]]、[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]。"},{"id":"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"固定 $S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$、$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 及 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 的同一 $g,d,a_T,\\mathrm{Prf}_T$ 呈示；无下标的 $\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner$ 是 [[90-df-godel-number]] 中的 $g(\\sigma)$。谓词下标仍只有 $T$，其余项是已显式固定的环境常量。"},{"id":"9f8586e4baa616ce","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$g,d$ 满足上述 $\\mathrm{GN}$；$\\mathrm{Sub}_S$ 必须是同一 $S,g$、同一指定变量的实际代入函数。$\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G$ 必须由 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 对该 $G,g$ 及固定公理验证程序构造，不是任取一个二元关系。故呈现包含该验证程序的固定选择。"},{"id":"c4cc1405929acfc1","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"固定 $S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$、$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 及 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 的同一 $g,d,a_T,\\mathrm{Prf}_T$ 呈示；无下标的 $\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner$ 是 [[90-df-godel-number]] 中的 $g(\\sigma)$。谓词下标仍只有 $T$，其余项是已显式固定的环境常量。"},{"id":"f93e27fe7f2babaf","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,g$ 是固定有效算术语法环境，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$；